<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Rockwell restarted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Rockwell restarted.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it reinstated coverage of Rockwell International Corp with near- and long-term accumulate ratings.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 5/8 to 61-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
